# C08 evidence keeps its exact bytes so SHA256.txt matches the committed blob.
# Same convention as evidence/e2e/c01/2026-10-29/.gitattributes: the root
# `* text=auto` rule would otherwise rewrite CRLF and break the recorded hashes.
* -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
